The problem requires maximizing total benefit from ordering vehicles, subject to a total inventory capacity. Each vehicle type has a benefit (Value) and a weight (Weight), and the total number of vehicles ordered for each type (x_i) must not exceed the overall capacity. The variables x_i are nonnegative integers. All data is to be used as given, with identifiers and coefficients preserved.

